# Only what the Dockerfile copies matters; keep everything else (and anything secret) out of
# the build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.vscode
.env
.env.*
services/api/bin
services/api/internal/webui/dist
apps/web/screenshots
docs
